    "detailed_description": "Help the stickman defend his castle from the siege weapons of the enemy. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse the slingshot, ballista or cannon to throw stones at the opponents and break their military mechanisms and siege towers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has a simple intuitive control. Pull and throw a projectile at the enemy to charge the slingshot and select the tension force. Release to launch the projectile into the enemy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor each struck enemy you will earn coins which help you to upgrades a weapon, turret or your equipment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe are waiting for your wishes and comments on the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHave a good game!",
